body:prose = >`
  &ND v2

  # AEON v1 Conformance Matrix [# aeon-v1-conformance-matrix]

  The authoritative conformance mapping for AEON v1 now lives with
  [@ https://github.com/aeonite-org/aeonite-cts | [$ aeonite-org/aeonite-cts]].

  Use the CTS-owned copy for:

  - requirement-to-suite mapping
  - lane and manifest anchoring
  - public conformance coverage review

  Relevant public entry points:

  - [@ https://github.com/aeonite-org/aeonite-cts | CTS repository]
  - [@ https://github.com/aeonite-org/aeonite-cts/blob/main/CONFORMANCE-COVERAGE.md | Conformance coverage]

  This spec-side document remains only as a forward pointer so the specification surface can reference the CTS mapping without duplicating ownership.
`
